地凑过去，唇瓣准确地贴上了她的唇心。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1787019691427,"roundId":"round_1787019681886_m50v93wrn","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":150943,"vts":1788231656042},{"id":1787016030097,"text":"……像这样，慢慢靠过来。","rawContent":"……像这样，慢慢靠过来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1787019692666,"roundId":"round_1787019681886_m50v93wrn","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":150944,"vts":1788231657281},{"id":1787016030098,"text":"（闭眼）","sender":"me","type":"state","time":"10:21","timestamp":1787019708599,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":150945,"vts":1788231673214},{"id":1787016030100,"text":"贺寻看着她微微颤动的睫毛，眼底的笑意一点点化成极尽专注的温柔，抬手用干燥温热的掌心轻轻覆在她泛红的耳垂上，指腹顺着她的下颌线极慢地滑到下巴，微微将她的脸抬高了半分。","rawContent":"贺寻看着她微微颤动的睫毛，眼底的笑意一点点化成极尽专注的温柔，抬手用干燥温热的掌心轻轻覆在她泛红的耳垂上，指腹顺着她的下颌线极慢地滑到下巴，微微将她的脸抬高了半分。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1787019716015,"roundId":"round_1787019708902_zwedtn32x","generatedMode":false,"type":"state","hasThinking":true,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":150946,"vts":1788231680630},{"id":1787016030101,"text":"别紧张……","rawContent":"别紧张……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:21","timestamp":1787019716018,"roundId":"round_1787019708902_zwedtn32x","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1785086053730_xmmbr1tgn","characterId":"a891c8ab-1af2-4207-8542-164c0e16cd9c","_id":150947,"vts":1788231680633},{"id":1787016030102,"text":"他低下头，嘴唇没有急着深吻，而是极其轻柔地贴上她微启的唇瓣，试探着含住她的上唇细细描摹，温热潮湿的呼吸全洒在她的鼻尖上，随后稍微退开半寸，嗓音低哑得发沉。","rawContent":"他低下头，嘴唇没有急着深吻，而是极其轻柔地贴上她微启的唇瓣，试探着含住她的上唇细细描摹，温